      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/justindoodler/{size}/4832_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-02-27T12:45:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just as I am playing around with character creation, I thought I would share some here. This is John Bull, Britain's cyborg Super Soldier! Haven't written up his bio yet, but Bradley, a popular British soldier, was severely injured in a bomb attack in Afghanistan, leaving him with both legs and an arm amputated. The British government used an experimental nanobot cyborg surgery to restore his limbs, granting him incredible physical prowess. However, when his medical facility  was attacked by enemy forces, the secrets to his incredible technology have now been lost. <br>\n </p>\n<p><strong>John Bull</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Alias: </strong>Bradley Bullock</p>\n<p><strong>Gender: </strong>Male</p>\n<p><b>Age:</b> Mid Thirties</p>\n<p><b>Height:</b> 6’5\"</p>\n<p><b>Eyes: </b>Hazel</p>\n<p><b>Hair:</b> Dark Brown</p>\n<p><b>Skin: </b>White</p>\n<p><b>Build: </b>Athletic</p>\n<p><b>Costume/Equipment:</b> John Bull wears a patriotic red,white and blue costume and stylised bull helmet.</p>\n<p><b>Background: </b>Military </p>\n<p><b>Power Source: </b>Tech Upgrades </p>\n<p><b>Archetype: </b>Physical Powerhouse </p>\n<p><b>Personality: </b>Impulsive (d6/d6/d10)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Powers</b></p>\n<p>Strength d10</p>\n<p>Speed d10</p>\n<p>Leaping d8</p>\n<p>Vitality d10</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Qualities</b></p>\n<p>Self Discipline d8</p>\n<p>Fitness d10</p>\n<p>Close combat d8</p>\n<p>Cyborg Supersoldier d8</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Health: </b>33 </p>\n<p><b>Status Dice</b></p>\n<p>d6 (33-26)</p>\n<p>d6 (25-13)</p>\n<p>d10 (12-1)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Principles</b></p>\n<p>Principle of the Defender</p>\n<p>Principle of the Indestructible</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Green Abilities</b></p>\n<p>Damage Resistance </p>\n<p>Power Strike (Strength)</p>\n<p>Bull Rush (Organic-Hack) (Speed)</p>\n<p>Principle of the  Defender</p>\n<p>Principle of Indestructibility</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Yellow Abilities</b></p>\n<p>Frontline Fighting (Close Combat)</p>\n<p>Energy Burst (Strength) </p>\n<p>Recharge (Vitality)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Red Qualities</b></p>\n<p>Major Regeneration (Vitality)</p>\n<p>Paragon Feat (Strength)</p>\n<p> </p>",
